WEBVTT

00:03:30.288 --> 00:03:32.871
Pathos is neither inherently good nor bad,

00:03:32.913 --> 00:03:35.954
but it may be irrational
and unpredictable.

00:03:35.996 --> 00:03:38.246
It can just as easily 
rally people for peace

00:03:38.288 --> 00:03:40.038
as incite them to war.

00:03:40.246 --> 00:03:41.413
Most advertising,

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:44.746
from beauty products that promise
to relieve our physical insecurities

00:03:44.788 --> 00:03:47.496
to cars that make us feel powerful,

00:03:47.538 --> 00:03:49.954
relies on pathos.

00:03:50.538 --> 00:03:54.121
Aristotle’s rhetorical appeals
still remain powerful tools today,

00:03:54.163 --> 00:03:55.746
but deciding which of them to use

00:03:55.788 --> 00:03:58.663
is a matter of knowing
your audience and purpose,

00:03:58.704 --> 00:04:01.038
as well as the right place and time.